  {
    "id": "evt_columbia_73518388",
    "event_id": "evt_columbia_73518388",
    "name": "Nurse State Legislators Webinar",
    "type": "Academic",
    "description": "<p>The Center for Health Policy is hosting a Webinar where an expert panel will discuss nurses&rsquo; role in health policy and advocacy.</p> <p>Panelists include New York State Assemblymember Karines Reyes; Darlene Curley, Chair of Utah Governor&rsquo;s Commission on Aging; Bethany Hall-Long, the 75th Governor of Delaware; Gale Adcock, Senator in the North Carolina General Assembly; and Ross Frommer, the Vice President for Government Affairs at Columbia University Irving Medical Center.</p> ...",
    "start_date": "2025-09-22",
    "end_date": "2025-09-22",
    "source": "columbia_",
    "source_group": "columbia_general",
    "source_url": "https://events.columbia.edu/cal/event/eventView.do?b=de&calPath=%2Fpublic%2Fcals%2FMainCal&guid=CAL-00bbdb71-98ea92e3-0198-ec487b73-00006116events%40columbia.edu&recurrenceId=",
    "source_name": "Columbia University",
    "venue_name": "Online Event",
    "venue_type": "Virtual",
    "is_academic": true,
    "category": [
      "HEALTH",
      "SCIENCE"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "evt_columbia_6dab20c5",
    "event_id": "evt_columbia_6dab20c5",
    "name": "Investment and Careers in Climate",
    "type": "Academic",
    "description": "<p>In the wake of federal rollbacks, climate professionals are increasingly turning to state and local governments, philanthropy, and the private sector to sustain the progress made. But where exactly is the money flowing&mdash;and what does that mean for your career?</p> <p>The Center on Global Energy Policy at Columbia University SIPA&rsquo;s Women in Energy initiative and Pillsbury invite you to join us for Follow the Capital: Investment and Careers in Climate, a timely conversation and ne...",
    "start_date": "2025-09-22",
    "end_date": "2025-09-22",
    "source": "columbia_",
    "source_group": "columbia_general",
    "source_url": "https://events.columbia.edu/cal/event/eventView.do?b=de&calPath=%2Fpublic%2Fcals%2FMainCal&guid=CAL-00bbdb7c-98742526-0198-75cbf34b-00004505events%40columbia.edu&recurrenceId=",
    "source_name": "Columbia University",
    "venue_name": "Pillsbury Winthrop Shaw Pittman, 31 West 52nd Street, 29th Floor, New York, NY 10019",
    "venue_type": "venue",
    "is_academic": true,
    "category": [
      "ARTS"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "evt_columbia_5581c314",
    "event_id": "evt_columbia_5581c314",
    "name": "Data and Partnerships for Global Clean Air and Climate",
    "type": "Academic",
    "description": "<p>Air pollution is a global public health crisis, causing more than 8 million premature deaths annually. The environmental damage of air pollution must be reversed hand in hand with addressing the climate challenge. Sensing, data science, and sustainable energy technology all help remove barriers towards progress towards cleaner air and sustainable climate. For real impact, this work must be co-designed and performed on a local level in partnership with those who are most affected. We will h...",
    "start_date": "2025-09-22",
    "end_date": "2025-09-22",
    "source": "columbia_",
    "source_group": "columbia_general",
    "source_url": "https://events.columbia.edu/cal/event/eventView.do?b=de&calPath=%2Fpublic%2Fcals%2FMainCal&guid=CAL-00bbdb7c-98370f12-0198-388161fa-0000424eevents%40columbia.edu&recurrenceId=",
    "source_name": "Columbia University",
    "venue_name": "Columbia Engineering Innovation Hub, 2276 12th Avenue, New York, NY 10027	2nd Floor",
    "venue_type": "venue",
    "is_academic": true,
    "category": [
      "HEALTH",
      "TECH"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "evt_columbia_d8f934d5",
    "event_id": "evt_columbia_d8f934d5",
    "name": "CET Taiwan | Information Session with Alumni!",
    "type": "Academic",
    "description": "<p>Are you interested in studying abroad in Taiwan? Join this virtual information session on <strong>Monday, September 22nd at 4:00 PM ET</strong> <a href=\"https://events.teams.microsoft.com/event/7f370376-ee22-4947-b8d8-9755708b1248@1eb1283f-7a15-43ab-84df-87a2f6ade4fd\" target=\"_blank\">hosted by CET Academic Programs</a> to learn more about study abroad in Taiwan. During this session, you will hear directly from recent program alums about their experience!</p> <p>Immerse yourself in the Chin...",
    "start_date": "2025-09-22",
    "end_date": "2025-09-22",
    "source": "columbia_",
    "source_group": "columbia_general",
    "source_url": "https://events.columbia.edu/cal/event/eventView.do?b=de&calPath=%2Fpublic%2Fcals%2FMainCal&guid=CAL-00bbdb70-989d4f10-0198-9fe2b242-00000bb3events%40columbia.edu&recurrenceId=",
