    "is_academic": true,
    "category": [
      "BUSINESS",
      "ARTS",
      "SCIENCE"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "evt_columbia_d63a3186",
    "event_id": "evt_columbia_d63a3186",
    "name": "Office Hours w/ Case Management and Student Support",
    "type": "Academic",
    "description": "<p>Do you have questions about services on campus or need help identifying resources in the community? If yes, then stop by for office hours to chat one on one with a member of our Case Management and Student Support team. Our Case Managers are knowledgeable about resources both on campus and in the community and are dedicated to helping all students, regardless of school, get connected to the resources they need to succeed. Some examples of topics we can help you with are basic needs support...",
    "start_date": "2025-09-23",
    "end_date": "2025-09-23",
