    "type": "Workshop",
    "description": "<p>This training session will cover:</p> <ul> <li>Opioid overview </li> <li>What an opioid overdose is </li> <li>Signs and symptoms of an opioid overdose </li> <li>What increases the risk of opioid overdose </li> <li>Medication for opioid use disorders </li> <li>What naloxone is and how it works </li> <li>Naloxone kit: components and use </li> <li>Response steps for a suspected overdose </li> <li>How to administer naloxone </li> <li>How to use Fentanyl Test Strips</li> <li>Distribution of nal...",
